<title>USA: Tesoro Alaska names Heep senior VP.</title>
<headline>Tesoro Alaska names Heep senior VP.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tesoro Alaska Petroleum Co said on Monday that it has picked Don Heep, chief financial officer at Valero Energy Corp, to become its senior vice president.</p>
<p>The position is new, said company spokeswoman Susan Pirotina.</p>
<p>Heep's responsibilities include accounting, planning, economics and government affairs, the company said.</p>
<p>Tesoro Alaska is a subsidiary of Tesoro Petroleum Corp.</p>
